    "intro_narrative": "You awaken to the shrill alarm of the ESS Aethelgard. The research station is drifting dangerously close to a black hole's event horizon. The primary AI has gone offline, locking down the navigation systems. You are in the engineering bay, surrounded by blinking server racks and manual override terminals. To escape the gravity well, you must manually recalibrate the Hyperdrive Controller. The systems are fragmented and encrypted; you'll need to route power and data through the backup subsystems to synthesize the correct launch coordinates. Time is short.",
    "narrative_style": "sci_fi"
  },
